        "procedure": "Path A: [(NCN)Lu(CH2C6H4NMe2-o)2] (0.883 g, 1 mmol) in toluene (20 mL) was treated slowly with AlMe3/heptane (3 mL, 1 M, 3 mmol). After a yellow-to-colorless color change and stirring about 24 h, toluene was removed, the residue washed twice with cold hexane (3 mL), redissolved in toluene, concentrated, and cooled to −35 °C to give colorless crystals after 3 days (0.520 g, 66%). Path B: AlMe3/heptane (0.6 mL, 1 M, 0.6 mmol) diluted with toluene (10 mL) was added to 2b (0.192 g, 0.1 mmol) in toluene (10 mL), stirred overnight at room temperature, and worked up similarly (0.048 g, 61%).",
